Helper class for simple, well-known key deserializers. The following kinds of objects can currently be handled:

* Primitive wrappers (Boolean, Byte, Char, Short, Integer, Float, Long, Double)
* Enums (usually unnecessary because EnumMap does not call us)
* {@link java.util.Date}
* {@link java.util.Calendar}
* {@link java.util.UUID}
* {@link java.util.Locale}
* Anything with a single-String-argument constructor (unless explicitly @JsonIgnore'd)
* Anything with a {@code static T valueOf(String)} factory method (unless explicitly @JsonIgnore'd)

